description	"ISB Tactical Agent 

A investigative infantry who prefers precise weaponry, teamwork and information over brute force.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- 22T4 ISB Special (Pistol 3)
-- 30% Less Damage
-- 20% Less RoF
-- Mag Reload

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Close Combat Training (2)
- 10 Percent Faster Hacking
- ISB Commlink (Tracking Beacon)
- Dexterity (1)			
- Assemble (2)
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS3]"